ne // as of 10/02/03","p":"2004_snapshot"},{"id":44923,"t":5008,"f":13,"u":5,"n":"GreyOrGray","d":"2003-12-30 02:10:28 UTC","s":"","x":"Kurt Cobain is one of the sexiest men... ever. There was just something about him that makes (some) girls (and guys) want him sooo bad. He was a beautiful person. Gah. So beautiful.","p":"2004_snapshot;2012_backup"},{"id":44948,"t":5761,"f":70,"u":611,"n":"socalledsumthin","d":"2003-12-30 02:43:43 UTC","s":"i never did this..... hmmmm","x":"im not sure what ya'll wanna know....\r\n\r\n\r\nso.. umm\r\n\r\nAge: 14 \r\nSex:Lady\r\nHeight: 5'5... 5'6... one of those\r\nWeight: 115\r\nHair color: only i know for sure ;-)... no really its dirty blonde.. but now its blondish brownish with redish streaks... kinda... \r\nEye color:blue-ish green-ish kinda... ish.... \r\n\r\nLikes: photography, writing, music, being with people... i dunno.... singing, dancing, movies, ... yeah... prolly more... \r\n\r\nDislikes: cheaters, posers, shallow people, math, history, gym, school in general... \r\n\r\nWhat I Am Scared Of: being alone... and the dark... and losing someone i love\r\n\r\nWhat i HATE: not many things... but i hate being told \"i love you\" when it's not true...  and i hate when people make fun of other people... it pisses me off \r\n\r\nBad Habits: im WAY too outspoken... i have a hard time admiting when im wrong... i procrastinate too much.... WAY too much... i say what is on my mind.. constant mood swings... im way too curious for my own good\r\n\r\nGood habits: ... when i find one ill get back to you\r\n\r\nStyle: i have my own style... its what-ever i damn well feel like ....\r\n\r\nPersonality: im very nice once you get to know me.... im funny... when i wanna be... im independent... im a good person.. really i am.... sometimes at least.... hmm... i alot of fun to be around ... im a good friend... im not the kind of person who talks behind other peoples backs... thats not my thing... and umm... i dont lie ... okay.. thats a lie.. nevermind that....  but i usually only lie to my parents... and like... teachers... and people like that.... yeah... okay.. im done\r\n\r\nwelp... if you wanna know something else... just tell me and ill tell you!  ;-)","p":"2004_snapshot"},{"id":44949,"t":5680,"f":71,"u":618,"n":"empty_minded_me","d":"2003-12-30 02:44:08 UTC","s":"","x":"LMAO I did that once too!!! My mom gave us some wine on New Years then she left to go to a party in Iowa City.  My sister and I got wasted.  Good times, good times...","p":"2004_snapshot"},{"id":44950,"t":5680,"f":71,"u":611,"n":"socalledsumthin","d":"2003-12-30 02:47:18 UTC","s":"","x":"see... i used to feel bad about doing that... but now its their fault... the stupid people... they left me all alone with the liquir and so... i mean... how could i resist? they just... left it there... they just left it there for me to drink... i mean.... its their fault they left it for me... right?\r\n\r\nlol...\r\nanyways... that thing you posted Brandon, is kinda ugly... lol","p":"2004_snapshot"},{"id":44952,"t":5680,"f":71,"u":687,"n":"heartless","d":"2003-12-30 02:48:35 UTC","s":"","x":"[quote:769887c1e9=\"alcoholic\"][color=darkred:769887c1e9][size=14:769887c1e9] :lol: nice.  but where's my glass of champagne for new years?[/size:769887c1e9][/color:769887c1e9][/quote:769887c1e9]\r\n\r\nthere's a little \"anoying blowy sound maker\" in his mouth\r\n\r\nalso, i've seen this before. you have the edited version. the other one says \"now leave me the fuck alone til next year\"","p":"2004_snapshot"},{"id":44996,"t":5764,"f":70,"u":28,"n":"trixsta24","d":"2003-12-30 06:27:22 UTC","s":"jus me","x":"eyyy...my names tiffany and i live in VA..im 18 (jus recently turned legal!woo! :)) i love writing and readin other peoples stuff....theres no need for me to drone on and on about what i do and what i dont , cuz i love to do alot..ill spare u the details lol... lotsa luv xoxo","p":"2004_snapshot"},{"id":45017,"t":5680,"f":71,"u":146,"n":"A_rAgInG_fIrE_iNsIdE","d":"2003-12-30 18:25:16 UTC","s":"","x":"[quote:4801102c15=\"empty_minded_me\"]Hehehe...that was cute.  My uncle gave my grandma  a bottle of wine for Christmas...[/quote:4801102c15]\r\n\r\nMy uncle did that too.. but I confiscated(sp?) it...\r\n\r\nYou know I had to try it to make sure it was safe for her.... :o","p":"2004_snapshot"},{"id":45018,"t":5008,"f":13,"u":146,"n":"A_rAgInG_fIrE_iNsIdE","d":"2003-12-30 18:32:58 UTC","s":"","x":"his eyes just draw you into his soul some how.....whenever I  see a picture of him I immediately focus on his eyes.","p":"2004_snapshot;2012_backup"},{"id":45025,"t":4783,"f":71,"u":146,"n":"A_rAgInG_fIrE_iNsIdE","d":"2003-12-30 19:06:22 UTC","s":"","x":"water and orange juice..\r\n\r\n\r\nI'm not much of a milk fan\r\n\r\never since half my school was out after drinking it..(including myself)\r\nI haven't drank it since and that was the 8th grade..\r\n\r\nthree years... wow doesn't seem that long ago...","p":"2004_snapshot;2012_backup"},{"id":45034,"t":4783,"f":71,"u":-1,"n":"Anonymous","d":"2003-12-30 20:46:25 UTC","s":"","x":"I dont like drinking milk at all. Ill only drink it if there lots of chocolate in it...yumm.... but yea i drink a lot of pepsi (A LOT OF IT) and i drink tea. Tea is my favorite thing to drink. I love to put lots of sugar in it.","p":"2004_snapshot;2012_backup"},{"id":45056,"t":4874,"f":12,"u":290,"n":"Rusted Chains","d":"2003-12-30 22:55:42 UTC","s":"","x":"That's terrible... My mom filed for divorce in Augest. Shortly (very shortly) after, we found out that my dad, who is 45, has had a 31 year old girlfriend since Febuary. They are still together. It makes me sick because he puts her above us sometimes. For new years, he thinks he's going to drive us all the way back home (3 1/2 hours away) and stay with my GRANDMA on new years just so he can be with his girlfriend. We would have to turn around and drive back up the next day. he can't torture his three kids like that. I'm sorry it just doesn't work that way. I would be missing training for races that weekend and it's such bullshit. So in some sort of fashion, I feel your pain. It makes me really uncomfortable too and I hate it. I'm sorry.  :(","p":"2004_snapshot;2012_backup"},{"id":45061,"t":5680,"f":71,"u":624,"n":"JOE","d":"2003-12-31 01:01:08 UTC","s":"","x":"[quote:123900e0ef=\"empty_minded_me\"]LMAO I did that once too!!! [/quote:123900e0ef]\r\n\r\nI regretted it an hour later.","p":"2004_snapshot"},{"id":45065,"t":4783,"f":71,"u":624,"n":"JOE","d":"2003-12-31 01:13:33 UTC","s":"","x":"I like juice (preferably grape) but I drink sweet tea more oftenly.","p":"2004_snapshot;2012_backup"},{"id":45067,"t":4874,"f":12,"u":76,"n":"Stolen Sanity","d":"2003-12-31 03:04:34 UTC","s":"","x":"my mom dates.....and well the only thing that bothers me is the fact she can't pick half decent guys....only jerks","p":"2004_snapshot;2012_backup"},{"id":45069,"t":4874,"f":12,"u":82,"n":"alcoholic","d":"2003-12-31 03:15:49 UTC","s":"","x":"[color=darkblue:e2c19cfd56][size=14:e2c19cfd56]a lot of girls seem to have a problem with that one..[/size:e2c19cfd56][/color:e2c19cfd56]","p":"2004_snapshot;2012_backup"},{"id":45078,"t":4874,"f":12,"u":76,"n":"Stolen Sanity","d":"2003-12-31 04:02:06 UTC","s":"","x":"yeah...she never listens to me about it either....","p":"2004_snapshot;2012_backup"},{"id":45092,"t":5770,"f":71,"u":598,"n":"Epiphany","d":"2003-12-31 05:48:58 UTC","s":"German Cannibal","x":"A German Man posted a request for another man to be voluntarally eaten. The two filmed what happened.\r\nHere's a Link to the New's Report. [url]http://www.cbsnews.com/stories/2003/12/04/world/main586717.shtml[/url]\r\n\r\n\r\nHere's some extra info I copy/pasted from some in depth coverage of the trial.\r\n\r\n          [quote:ed3e1c1cb0]The video of the torturing was shown in court. it was originally 4 hours long, but was condensed to 90 mins. it showed the guy cutting the man repeatedly, and hacking off his penis. when it would not slice all the way off, the \"victim\" told him to get a sharper knife. When it was off, the penis was sauteed in butter and garlic and shared by both men, though the \"victim\" ate his rare because he couldnt wait due to the pain. The \"victim\" was then placed in the bathtub for the night to bleed to death. When he was checked on later, the \"victim\" said, \"If i last the night, lets have my testicles for breakfast.\"[/quote:ed3e1c1cb0]\r\n\r\n :twisted: ~Edwin~ :twisted:","p":"2004_snapshot"},{"id":45093,"t":5770,"f":71,"u":381,"n":"DepressedInTheValley","d":"2003-12-31 05:52:17 UTC","s":"","x":"that is really f*ed up!","p":"2004_snapshot"},{"id":45094,"t":5770,"f":71,"u":598,"n":"Epiphany","d":"2003-12-31 06:00:32 UTC","s":"Yes it is","x":"I agree.\r\nThe odd part of the trial is..The man that was eaten on video agreed to partake in the what happens.and to be killed.\r\n\r\nIn Germany,Cannibalism isn't illegal. He can be tried a small sentance of Voluntary Killing. There trying to point out that he would be a threat to society if he was released. Also that before they did all that weird stuff to him, the volunter took sleep aids and drank some alchohol. Prosocuters figure he might not have been thinking clearly. Not Shit .He wasn't thinking clearly.\r\n\r\n[b:3575fa6355]A Movie Deal[/b:3575fa6355] is under process to make a film of the Cannibal's book he wrote while in prison awaiting trial.\r\n\r\n :twisted: ~Edwin~ :twisted:","p":"2004_snapshot"},{"id":45102,"t":5770,"f":71,"u":624,"n":"JOE","d":"2003-12-31 10:26:58 UTC","s":"","x":"Yeah, I heard abotu that before.\r\n\r\nCrazyness!!","p":"2004_snapshot"},{"id":45111,"t":4874,"f":12,"u":624,"n":"JOE","d":"2003-12-31 10:57:28 UTC","s":"","x":"[quote:b6ca8f0fab=\"Truly_me\"]I think that is a really short amount of time to wait to start dating. She should have waited longer and considered your feelings more.[/quote:b6ca8f0fab]\r\n\r\nYeah, I agree","p":"2004_snapshot;2012_backup"},{"id":45122,"t":5770,"f":71,"u":2,"n":"Forever","d":"2003-12-31 17:53:57 UTC","s":"","x":"I read that a couple weeks... my question is, what kind of a website allows you to meet people willing to be eaten?! www.cannibalfriendfinder.com ?","p":"2004_snapshot"},{"id":45124,"t":5770,"f":71,"u":611,"n":"socalledsumthin","d":"2003-12-31 17:59:26 UTC","s":"","x":"well what kind of person WANTS to be EATEN?!?!?!!?!?!!?!?!?\r\n\r\n\r\nthats just... nasty....\r\n\r\nand most likely VERY painful...\r\n\r\n\r\nugh... this world is disgusting!","p":"2004_snapshot"},{"id":45125,"t":5770,"f":71,"u":2,"n":"Forever","d":"2003-12-31 18:01:42 UTC","s":"","x":"Would you try a bite of cooked human flesh if you got the chance to? I would. Just cause I'm curious like that. I wouldn't kill someone just to taste them though.","p":"2004_snapshot"},{"id":45126,"t":5770,"f":71,"u":611,"n":"socalledsumthin","d":"2003-12-31 18:04:05 UTC","s":"","x":"no, i wouldnt... \r\n\r\nim a very picky eater... and alot of times i wont even eat animal meat... there is no way in hell im going to take a bite of human flesh... eww.","p":"2004_snapshot"},{"id":45130,"t":4783,"f":71,"u":146,"n":"A_rAgInG_fIrE_iNsIdE","d":"2003-12-31 19:39:18 UTC","s":"","x":"[quote:fac7816198=\"DarkAngelEyes666\"]I dont like drinking milk at all. Ill only drink it if there lots of chocolate in it...yumm.... [/quote:fac7816198]\r\n\r\nThat the type of milk that took out my whole school... :oops:","p":"2004_snapshot;2012_backup"},{"id":45227,"t":4459,"f":53,"u":146,"n":"A_rAgInG_fIrE_iNsIdE","d":"2004-01-01 22:12:28 UTC","s":"","x":"All of you need to come to Georgia.... this place sucks.. but at least if all of you came it wouldn't...","p":"2004_snapshot;2012_backup"},{"id":45251,"t":4459,"f":53,"u":5,"n":"GreyOrGray","d":"2004-01-02 02:15:14 UTC","s":"","x":"Umm... come see me? I'm not THAT far away.","p":"2004_snapshot;2012_backup"},{"id":45259,"t":5791,"f":113,"u":2,"n":"Forever","d":"2004-01-02 03:11:18 UTC","s":"Think","x":"[b:f6e83e7b1e]T[/b:f6e83e7b1e]hink [b:f